---
import { repo } from "../content";
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="display title" data-split><span class="soft">Scammers keep a parent alone.</span> Parent Line brings in the family.</h1>

    <div class="grid after-head">
      <div class="c-l" data-hero-intro>
        <p class="lead measure">When Mom's bank SMS looks like a scam, the family group gets an alarm, and two AI agents help them act.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="#alarm">Watch an alarm play out <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="textlink" href={repo}>Code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-r" aria-label="A bank SMS becomes an alarm in the family group">
        <div data-hero-sms>
          <div class="meta-row"><span>SBI, on Mom's phone</span><span>Fri 6 Nov, 23:40</span></div>
          <p class="sms" data-sms>Dear Customer, A/C X1234 debited by Rs.480000.00 on date 06Nov26 by IMPS to RAKESH KUMAR Ref 431234567890. If not u? call 1800111109. -SBI</p>
        </div>

        <div class="via">
          <svg class="via-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path class="soft-line" d="M12 0 V150" />
            <path class="ink-line" data-via-path d="M12 0 V150" />
            <rect class="paper-fill" x="5" y="68" width="14" height="14" />
            <rect class="ink-line" data-via-node x="5" y="68" width="14" height="14" />
            <circle class="stamp-fill" data-via-dot cx="12" cy="0" r="3.5" opacity="0" />
          </svg>
          <div class="via-text">
            <p class="meta">Bank watch</p>
            <ul class="rules">
              <li data-rule>over ₹50,000</li>
              <li data-rule>a payee never paid before</li>
              <li data-rule>late at night</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-hero-alarm>
          <div class="meta-row"><span>Bank watch, in the family group</span><span>23:40</span></div>
          <p class="h3 alarm alarm-title">Bank alarm: Mom, 23:40</p>
          <p class="h4">₹4,80,000 left the account to RAKESH KUMAR.</p>
          <p class="meta">@guardian over to you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { border-top: 0; padding-top: calc(64px + clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px)); }
  .title { max-width: 14ch; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 20px 28px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .sms { margin-top: 16px; font: 400 var(--fs-small)/1.65 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .via { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: var(--sp-item); height: 150px; margin-block: 20px; }
  .via-svg { width: 24px; height: 150px; }
  .via-text { align-self: center; }
  .rules { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 2px; font: 400 0.8125rem/1.6 var(--mono); }
  .rules li::before { content: "→ "; color: var(--stamp); }
  .alarm-title { margin-top: 18px; }
  [data-hero-alarm] p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
</style>
